    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>(Prerequisite: Ravenloft Campaign)</em></p><p>Contact with alien horrors, such as those of the Far Realm, has reshaped your body in unnatural ways. You gain the following features.</p><p><strong>Breathless.</strong> You can hold your breath for 1 hour.</p><p><strong>Extrasensory Perception.</strong> You gain proficiency in the Perception skill if you lack it, and you have Expertise in that skill. You also have Blindsight with a range of 15 feet.</p><p><strong>Warping Flesh.</strong> Immediately after you roll a 1 on the d20 of a D20 Test, the aberrant influence within you flares and seizes control of your flesh. Make a Constitution saving throw (DC 13 plus your Proficiency Bonus). On a failure, you have the &amp;Reference[Stunned] condition until the end of your next turn.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-7kZlse6wOfdOuzeN\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>The effect <em>Extrasensory Perception</em> gives the Blindsight. <em>Warping Flesh</em> is a Constitution saving throw against DC 13 + your Proficiency Bonus; on a failure, apply its effect (Stunned).</p></section>",
      "chat": ""
    },
